  "prefLabel": "Env-WMC 204.04 Identification of Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 204.04 Identification of Documents. Subsequent to the filing of a notice of appeal, the docket number assigned by the appeals clerk pursuant to Env-WMC 204.03(a) shall be used by all parties to identify all correspondence and other documents submitted to the council relating to the appeal, including any written testimony or exhibits used at a hearing.\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wmc200.html"
